                  "content": "presentation-japan/\n  ├── Keynote.jsx          (solo, ~22 slides)\n  ├── MainTalk.jsx         (LeRenzo + Priyanka, ~33 slides)\n  ├── src/components/      (Japan-specific: JEPXChart,\n  │                         JapanGridMap, KyushuChart...)\n  ├── src/theme.japan.js   (adapted color tokens)\n  └── vite.config.js\n\nShared from presentation/src/components/\n  VPPArchitecture, ChoreographyLoop,\n  ResponseTimeline, StreamingAggregation",
